{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2151"},"reason":"Notes now mention the second known Maya text naming the 13th b'ak'tun ending (La Corona Hieroglyphic Stairway 2, Block V, found 2012), which only mentions the date — so Tortuguero Monument 6 stays the only text that says anything about it, as the wording's 'detailed' implies.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://mayadecipherment.com/2012/06/30/notes-on-a-new-text-from-la-corona/"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["=",43],["+"," A second Maya text, Block V of Hieroglyphic Stairway 2 at La Corona (Guatemala, found in 2012), also names the 13th b'ak'tun ending, but only in passing; Tortuguero Monument 6 remains the only one that says anything about it."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["=",41],["+"," Ein zweiter Maya-Text, Block V der Hieroglyphentreppe 2 von La Corona (Guatemala, 2012 gefunden), nennt das Ende des 13. Baktun ebenfalls, aber nur beiläufig; das Monument 6 von Tortuguero bleibt der einzige Text, der etwas darüber aussagt."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["=",39],["+"," Второй майяский текст — блок V иероглифической лестницы 2 в Ла-Короне (Гватемала, найден в 2012 году) — тоже упоминает окончание 13-го бактуна, но лишь мимоходом; монумент 6 из Тортугеро остаётся единственным текстом, который что-то о нём сообщает."]]}],"hash":"1bb3f455a3f6","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"741cbbb8abcb08d9dbfe20933dc9faeb0e59901ac2099613f31f24fd3151b080"},
